    "language": "text",
    "contract": "Consumers can associate a shard identifier with independently replaceable PostgreSQL read and write connection endpoints. Through IShardConnectionConfiguration, the read and write endpoint accessors expose the same endpoint instances supplied through the typed properties; a new instance supplies distinct typed endpoint objects for both roles."
